  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel that it isn't right to give players the veteran rank in the beta and then take it away soon after.  I think if it isn't in the trust system, then there should be some sort of badge on your name.  As a veteran I felt responsible and the need to be a good role model for newer players and it shouldn't just be done away with.",
